!CHECK 235264.00 | 220453.00 80 022000.20 50 | line 4 L(BU,18),KSILO+2. (h2 byte prints "5C")
!CHECK 235265.00 | 232542.00 80 022000.23 10 | line 5 KF(BU,18),ABSSID (printed "ABSSIC")
